# Root .dockerignore — applies to the ai-python image, whose build context is
# the repository root (see ai-python/Dockerfile). Keep ai-python/ + Aegis-AI/;
# drop everything else, plus heavy/mutable/secret paths inside the kept trees.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend
backend
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env
ai-python/scratch
ai-python/tests
# Mutable, PII-bearing runtime memory — mounted as a volume, never baked.
Aegis-AI/layer3/conversation_memory
Aegis-AI/layer3/customer_profile
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
